    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>You are in tune with your mind, and the spirit within. Others who would seek to control you seem to need to struggle against an otherworldly force. You gain a +1 circumstance bonus to Will saving throws against mental effects. If you roll a success on your saving throw against a mental effect that would make you controlled, you get a critical success instead.</p>"
    },
